OL,3,AGovernment set to nationalise troubled
OL,4,Asteel firm
OL,5,
OL,6,FA plan to nationalise the UK's
OL,7,Fthird-largest steelworks is being
OL,8,Fdeveloped by the government, MPs have
OL,9,Fbeen told.
OL,11,FBusiness Secretary Jonathan Reynolds
OL,12,Ftold the House of Commons ministers
OL,13,Fwere looking to acquire Speciality
OL,14,FSteel UK (SSUK), which has sites in
OL,15,FStocksbridge and Rotherham in South
OL,16,FYorkshire and Wednesbury in the West
OL,17,FMidlands.
OL,19,FThe government initially took control
OL,20,Fof SSUK, previously part of Liberty
OL,21,FSteel, last year after it was forced to
OL,22,Fliquidate by the High Court.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,115,105,200,300,0,100
